OL,3,GNEWSARescuers out in 'horrific' storm
OL,4,Ato find lost man
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive teams of mountain rescuers were
OL,7,Fout in "horrific" conditions in Storm
OL,8,FAusten to search for a lost man.
OL,10,FWasdale Mountain Rescue Team (WMRT)
OL,11,Fsaid a large-scale emergency response
OL,12,Fwas involved to find a young man who
OL,13,Fhad set off Seathwaite to Scafell Pike
OL,14,Fon Friday morning - during Storm Austen
OL,15,F- and had not returned.
OL,17,FChad Dixon, from WMRT, said crews were
OL,18,Fout in 50-60mph winds and wet snow
OL,19,Funtil he was found in the Upper Esk at
OL,20,Fabout 03:00 on Saturday 24 October,
OL,21,Fwhere he was found "very cold and
OL,22,Fexhausted" but "a very lucky chap".
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
