OL,3,GNEWSARescuers out in 'horrific' storm
OL,4,Ato find lost man
OL,5,
OL,6,FUrging people to think before heading
OL,7,Fout into the hills as a second storm
OL,8,Fbatters Cumbria, Dixon added: "Why
OL,9,Fshould anybody be out in this weather?"
